# Phishing Website Detection using Deep Learning

## 📌 About the Project

This project uses a deep learning model to detect whether a website URL is legitimate or potentially phishing.

The model analyzes URL-based features and predicts:

- ✅ Legitimate Website
- ⚠️ Phishing Website

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- TensorFlow / Keras
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Google Colab
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

